Buzz relay — vendored into maxplayerai
======================================

The code under `crates/buzz/` is a vendored subset of the Buzz communications
platform, copied so the maxplayerai project can own, build, and deploy the
events + git + payments relay directly.

    Upstream:  github.com/gudnuf/buzz  (a fork of github.com/block/buzz)
    Branch:    sync/upstream-recarry-2026-07-24
